# NOTE: do NOT add a blanket `*.md` rule. IaC/**/envs/_template/README.md is listed
# in _TEMPLATE_OWNED_FILES (server/services/cloud_provisioning.py) and is copied into
# every stack workspace by _sync_iac_assets at runtime, so those files must ship.
# Top-level project docs are excluded individually instead.
/README.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/GOVERNANCE.md
/SECURITY.md
